[section:roadmap Limitations and Roadmap]

The authoritative list of what is not supported yet lives in
[@https://github.com/rjahanbakhshi/boost.taar/blob/master/ROADMAP.md ROADMAP.md]
in the repository and is updated as items close. In outline:

* /Inherent to the surfaces/: streaming results are REST-only; return
  types without a JSON representation cannot be RPC or MCP results; REST
  and MCP sessions are separate stores.
* /Transport/: no HTTP/2 or compression.
* /MCP/: `{name}`-only resource templates; stdio is POSIX-only.
* /OpenAPI/: no default values, security schemes, constraints or reusable
  components.
* /REST/: no streaming handler under `with_session`; repeated query keys
  are ambiguous.

[endsect]
